 the terms. robinhood:0x58ffe4a942d3885baa22d7520691f611ef09e7aa  average wafer price passed $10,000 and it wants operating control of any Terafab deal, while $ASML raised EUV prices","url":"https://x.com/_guptashubham/status/2110962492277137778"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111258164549316609"]},"author_id":"330273501","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:49:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111258169653780668"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/62MRRg3VYV","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/flytothesky777/status/2111258169653780668/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111258164549316609","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/62MRRg3VYV"}]},"id":"2111258169653780668","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":113,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"THE COMPANIES THAT KEEP INVESTING IN CAPEX WILL WIN — NOT THE ONES THAT FOLLOW FEAR\n\nMy view is simple:\n\nIn the AI era, the final winners will not be the companies that retreat whenever markets become afraid.\n\nThey will be the companies that keep investing through fear.\n\nMarkets https://t.co/62MRRg3VYV","url":"https://x.com/flytothesky777/status/2111258169653780668"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111336406664515584"]},"author_id":"785856172209373184","created_at":"2026-10-17T06:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111336409625760162"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/AgXI37hVI9","end":306,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2111336409625760162/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111336406664515584","start":283,"url":"https://t.co/AgXI37hVI9"}]},"id":"2111336409625760162","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":68,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"☕ La semaine IA &amp; semi-conducteurs en 8 points ↓\n\n1) TSMC — record trimestriel et guidance relevée pour Q4\n\nTSMC publie un T3 2026 à NT$1,494,2 Mds de chiffre d’affaires et NT$763,1 Mds de bénéfice net (EPS NT$29,43), au‑dessus des attentes, et relève sa croissance 2026 à ~+44% https://t.co/AgXI37hVI9","url":"https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2111336409625760162"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110716675834392576","3_2110716676048396288"]},"author_id":"380820651","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110906070340399257"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/1K15Nplk4S","end":163,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2110906070340399257/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110716675834392576","start":140,"url":"https://t.co/1K15Nplk4S"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/1K15Nplk4S","end":163,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2110906070340399257/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110716676048396288","start":140,"url":"https://t.co/1K15Nplk4S"}]},"id":"2110906070340399257","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":29,"impression_count":15332,"like_count":123,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":7},"text":"大家以為台積電的封裝還缺到卡住客戶，其實這次法說，魏哲家的口氣放軟了。\n\n7 月法說，他說封裝產能不足，「已成為支援客戶的瓶頸」，還歡迎其他家的方案來分擔。這次被問到，他的說法是後段「確實有一點短缺」。\n\n從「瓶頸」變成「有一點」，CoWoS 產能數字一樣沒給。\n\n被問到英特爾 https://t.co/1K15Nplk4S","url":"https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2110906070340399257"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111247429450477568"]},"author_id":"1792373672956899328","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:06:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111247436287201509"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/78POKr3yby","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FarmerTv61658/status/2111247436287201509/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111247429450477568","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/78POKr3yby"}]},"id":"2111247436287201509","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":143,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"สรุปภาพรวมพอร์ต 117 ตัว (ข้อมูลประมาณ 16-17 ต.ค. 2026)\nพอร์ตเน้น AI / Semiconductor / Space / Mega-tech เป็นหลัก มีความเสี่ยงสูง-ผันผวนสูงในช่วงนี้ เพราะตลาด tech/AI กำลังปรับฐานจากกังวล valuation สูง, ดอกเบี้ย/อัตราผลตอบแทนพันธบัตร, หนี้การลงทุน AI infrastructure และผล earnings https://t.co/78POKr3yby","url":"https://x.com/FarmerTv61658/status/2111247436287201509"},{"article":{"title":"404K SEMI-AI Evening Brief — October 15, 2026: Demand and Credit Divergence: TSMC Accelerates"},"author_id":"849661480869912576","created_at":"2026-10-16T03:19:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110933691837174238"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2110…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2110933430095781888","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2110933430095781888","url":"https://t.co/U1rbI8VRhI"}]},"id":"2110933691837174238","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2043,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/U1rbI8VRhI","url":"https://x.com/OptionKing666/status/2110933691837174238"},{"author_id":"6611952","created_at":"2026-10-17T08:40:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111376674793119988"],"id":"2111376674793119988","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":86,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Applied Materials、Lam","url":"https://x.com/got/status/2111376674793119988"},{"author_id":"174073808","created_at":"2026-10-15T22:07:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110855107445477660"],"id":"2110855107445477660","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":112,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Daily Semi Analytics: ASML is quietly building a hybrid bonder, and Besi should be nervous\n\nOne topic tonight: hybrid bonding. SemiAnalysis published new work today arguing ASML is building a die-to-wafer (D2W) hybrid bonding tool. ASML has not announced anything, so treat this","url":"https://x.com/xiangwei36/status/2110855107445477660"},{"author_id":"1627844367565340672","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:48:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110910683252666840"],"id":"2110910683252666840","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":685,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"半導体業界は歴史的な好況なのに、半導体株は売られている\nサムスン、ASML、TSMCの決算は過去最高水準で、AI向けHBMや先端半導体の需要は依然として旺盛。2027年に向けても成長が期待されている","url":"https://x.com/XmGnzg/status/2110910683252666840"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110812096644730880"]},"author_id":"2075042885888790528","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:01:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111246059934568608"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/prNsFiyjhi","end":169,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2111246059934568608/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110812096644730880","start":146,"url":"https://t.co/prNsFiyjhi"}]},"id":"2111246059934568608","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":458,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【半導体初心者講座 #11】\n\n今回は「半導体製造装置とは？」です🔰\n\n半導体製造装置とは、半導体を加工・製造・検査するための機械のこと。\n\nNVIDIAやAMDが優れた半導体を設計しても、それを実際に作るためには高度な製造装置が欠かせません！\n\n🔹 主な製造装置の種類\n\n✅ 成膜装置\n→ https://t.co/prNsFiyjhi","url":"https://x.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2111246059934568608"},{"author_id":"2070098022244237312","created_at":"2026-10-17T02:12:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111279028405711149"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/ajmdgj34/statu…","end":170,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/ajmdgj34/status/2110197653728538784","start":147,"url":"https://t.co/Ry6AID5QiY"}]},"id":"2111279028405711149","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":445,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【半導体・メモリ関連企業の決算状況（10/17時点）】\n\n世界の半導体・メモリ関連企業の決算が相次いで発表されています。\n既に発表された主要企業の前年同期比を整理しました。\n\n■ Micron（米国・メモリ）\n2026年度4Q（9/30発表）\n売上高：542.3億ドル（前年比＋379.1%） https://t.co/Ry6AID5QiY","url":"https://x.com/ajmdgj34/status/2111279028405711149"},{"article":{"title":"Micron売りは誤爆だ——AI半導体を壊すのは中国勢ではなく「供給の成功」である"},"author_id":"1912797175907840000","created_at":"2026-10-17T10:46:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111408610169536583"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2111…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2111408605975203842","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2111408605975203842","url":"https://t.co/JRxMxCNUlW"}]},"id":"2111408610169536583","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":9811,"like_count":19,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/JRxMxCNUlW","url":"https://x.com/FukuroStocks/status/2111408610169536583"},{"author_id":"1864777002143879170","created_at":"2026-10-16T02:01:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110913897016545706"],"id":"2110913897016545706","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":536,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"TSMC\n\n質疑応答の要約（質問順）\n1. ローラ・チェン氏（シティ）\n\n質問①：電力・資金調達・HBM・先端パッケージ・光通信用レーザーなど、AIの供給網には多くのボトルネックがある。チップだけ作りすぎる「過剰投資」をどう避けるのか。","url":"https://x.com/iDsmwA4fng14727/status/2110913897016545706"},{"author_id":"1506939373535006720","created_at":"2026-10-17T03:21:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111296490966774042"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":4,"start":0,"tag":"TSM"}]},"id":"2111296490966774042","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":118,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"$TSM  컨퍼런스콜 Q&amp;A 정리\n\nQ1\nAI 반도체 수요가 공격적으로 늘고 있는데, AI 매출 연평균 성장률(CAGR)을 지금은 어떻게 보나? 데이터센터 전력, 자금 조달, HBM(고대역폭 메모리)·ABF 기판·첨단 패키징, 네트워크용 레이저 부족 같은 제약이 칩 공급과 실제 AI 구축 사이에 어긋남을 만들면, 과잉","url":"https://x.com/ck61274352/status/2111296490966774042"},{"author_id":"1694279351246942208","created_at":"2026-10-16T00:00:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110883517743939962"],"id":"2110883517743939962","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":326,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"☀️ 10월 16일(금) 아침 투자 브리핑\n\n오늘 시장의 핵심은 ‘AI 산업의 실적은 좋은데 AI 관련 주가는 왜 하락하는가?’임.\nTSMC는 6분기 연속 사상 최대 분기 순이익을 기록했지만, 시장은 AI 인프라 투자에 투입되는 막대한 자금과 금리 부담을 우려하고 있음. 국내 코스피는 서킷브레이커까지 발동된","url":"https://x.com/honsu